'''javascript
class ClassA {
    constructor() {}
}

class ClassB {
    constructor() {}
}
'''

##### 正确示例
'''javascript
class ClassA {
    constructor() {}
}

// ClassB应放在一个单独的文件中。
'''

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule enforces that each file can only contain a single class.

##### Rule Meaning
Maintaining a single responsibility for each file helps improve the readability, maintainability, and reusability of the code. When multiple classes are included in a file, it increases the complexity of understanding and managing it.

